    <string name="lemuroid_help_content"><![CDATA[
        <b>&#8226;How do I use Arcadune?</b><br/>
        Copy all your ROMs files into a directory on your device and select it within Arcadune. This directory is allowed to have subdirectories. After the scan completes you should see your games.<br/><br/>
        <b>&#8226;Why aren\'t my games detected?</b><br/>
        If your games are compressed, try uncompressing them. If this doesn\'t work try putting ROMs into separate directories, one for each system with the following names: $SYSTEMS.<br/><br/>
        <b>&#8226;Credits</b><br/>
        Arcadune is based on Lemuroid by Swordfish90 and is free software released under the GNU GPL v3. Emulation is provided by Libretro cores, each under its own license.
    ]]></string>

    <string name="lemuroid_crash_disclamer">It looks like the Libretro core has experienced an unexpected issue. If it\'s persistent please try the following:\n
